# Desktop WinUI Verification

- For changes under `src/Faryma.Composer.Desktop`, prefer the smallest desktop-scoped verification that confirms the behavior.
- Run verification commands from the `backend` workspace root.
- Build the WinUI project with Visual Studio MSBuild, not `dotnet build`, so XAML compilation runs in the supported environment.
- Use:
  `& "C:\Program Files\Microsoft Visual Studio\18\Community\MSBuild\Current\Bin\MSBuild.exe" "src\Faryma.Composer.Desktop\Faryma.Composer.Desktop.csproj" /restore /p:Configuration=Debug /p:Platform=x64`
